.nh
.TH "glab" "1" "Sep 2026" "Auto generated by spf13/cobra" ""

.SH "نام (NAME)"
glab-token-list \- List user, group, or project access tokens.


.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBglab token list [flags]\fP


.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
List all tokens for a user, group, or project.

.PP
The output contains the token's meta information, not the actual token value. The output format
can be "JSON" or "text". The access level property is printed in human-readable form in the text
output, but displays the integer value in JSON.

.PP
Administrators can list tokens of other users.


.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
\fB-a\fP, \fB--active\fP[=false]
	List only the active tokens.

.PP
\fB-g\fP, \fB--group\fP=""
	List group access tokens. Ignored if a user or repository argument is set.

.PP
\fB--jq\fP=""
	Filter JSON output with a jq expression.

.PP
\fB-F\fP, \fB--output\fP="text"
	Format output as: text, json. text provides a readable table, json outputs the tokens with metadata.

.PP
\fB-R\fP, \fB--repo\fP=""
	Select another repository. You can use either OWNER/REPO or GROUP/NAMESPACE/REPO. The full URL or Git URL is also accepted.

.PP
\fB-U\fP, \fB--user\fP=""
	List personal access tokens. Use @me for the current user.


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	Show help for this command.


.SH "مثال (EXAMPLE)"
.EX
# List the current project's access tokens
glab token list
glab token list --output json

# List the project access tokens of a specific project
glab token list --repo user/my-repo

# List group access tokens
glab token list --group group/sub-group

# List my personal access tokens
glab token list --user @me

# Administrators only: list the personal access tokens of another user
glab token list --user johndoe
.EE


.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
\fBglab-token(1)\fP
